'''Frost naguas''' are [[Slayer monster]]s that require level 48 [[Slayer]] to kill. They are found in the [[Ruins of Tapoyauik]], accessed from the [[Twilight Temple]], after completion of the [[The Heart of Darkness]] quest.

As with their [[Sulphur Nagua|sulphurous]] and [[Earthen Nagua|earthen]] counterparts, Frost Nagua have -4 [[flat armour]], so all successful hits will do an extra 4 damage to them.

[[Protect from Magic]] will negate all damage from their basic attacks. Following 6-7 basic attacks after spawning, the Frost Nagua will mark the ground under the player's feet with icicles, which will erupt after a short period, draining some of the player's prayer. This can be dodged by stepping onto another tile. This attack pattern then repeats.

